  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to update the fcrepo `.travis.yml` to begin deploying Fedora snapshot Maven artifacts.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The successful completion of this task should result in snapshots being deployed on every successful build of the `master` branch to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/snapshots/org/fcrepo/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/snapshots/org/fcrepo/",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "====",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "As a separate note, the current Fedora Jenkins service is unable to successfully build due to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3281"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3281",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In addition to building, that service is also responsible for two other tasks:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "publishing snapshot artifacts",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "deploying the fcrepo.war to ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://demo.fcrepo.org:8080/"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://demo.fcrepo.org:8080/",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If this ticket is successful, and we find another way of deploying the demo instance, we could potentially remove the Jenkins service.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
