  "description": "<p>This task is to update the fcrepo `.travis.yml` to begin deploying Fedora snapshot Maven artifacts.<br/>\nThe successful completion of this task should result in snapshots being deployed on every successful build of the `master` branch to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/snapshots/org/fcrepo/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/snapshots/org/fcrepo/</a></p>\n\n<p>====<br/>\nAs a separate note, the current Fedora Jenkins service is unable to successfully build due to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3281\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3281</a></p>\n\n<p>In addition to building, that service is also responsible for two other tasks:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>publishing snapshot artifacts</li>\n\t<li>deploying the fcrepo.war to <a href=\"http://demo.fcrepo.org:8080/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://demo.fcrepo.org:8080/</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>If this ticket is successful, and we find another way of deploying the demo instance, we could potentially remove the Jenkins service.</p>",
